/*
 main.objc3 — Native Linux SDL2 + OpenGL 3.3 Core desktop shell for xsComic.

 Architecture:
   - Single-process, minimal-dependency Linux desktop UI built on SDL2,
     OpenGL 3.3 Core, SDL2_ttf (DejaVu Sans), and libpng.
   - Reactive zero-busy-wait event loop: background archive open / image decode
     completions push a registered SDL user event via xsc_set_main_wakeup() so
     SDL_WaitEventTimeout() wakes instantaneously and drains xsc_main_drain().
   - Analytical SDF rounded-rectangle + cached TTF glyph OpenGL 3.3 chrome
     renderer delivering a modern dark studio UI with toolbar, collapsible page
     sidebar, empty-state CTA, page-jump modal, settings popover, loading/error
     overlays, and deterministic CLI / --screenshot PNG capture.
 */

